* never itself a vector) -- rejected at parse time with "field 'k' must be a scalar (e.g. '2.0')
* or a matrix (e.g. '[[1,0],[0,1]]') -- got a flat list '[1,2,3]', which is not a valid Gain
* shape" (see test_gain.py::test_flat_list_k_rejected).
